    "name": "SP107E/SP110E LED Controller",
    "notes": "SPI LED pixel controllers used in LEDs2RAVE4/Lunchbox Dream LED products. SP107E (LED Chord) and SP110E (LED Hue) share the same BLE UUIDs but have different command bytes. SP107E adds music-reactive modes and matrix support. 4-byte command format: [data1] [data2] [data3] [cmd_byte]. Notifications arrive on the same FFE1 characteristic.\n",
